{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become an investigator and uncover the hidden truths shrouded in darkness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620360/extras/68c6d931-7596-4214-b44d-d94818cd0b30.gif?t=1744675198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620360/extras/7106df94-b17e-47a9-94ed-c148310ef2c7.gif?t=1744675198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist responds to a report of a discovered corpse and heads to the scene. As the investigation progresses, they get closer to uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find passwords and hidden clues, proceed with the investigation, and survive to make it through the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>With flat 2D graphics and a visual novel-style progression, there are no challenging controls.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620360/extras/71a3efeb-7381-42a2-b4cc-b40ea9257bd4.gif?t=1744675198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620360/extras/66bbb7dd-0620-469f-9af1-2c32c3f0403d.gif?t=1744675198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Dark Story: Starving Child, players do not move or jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game progresses by clicking on objects on the screen or reading the protagonist's dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Most actions in the game operate through mouse movement and clicks.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Look for interactive elements!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620360/extras/dcc455f3-9780-4d04-a495-16e5fda4dfb3.gif?t=1744675198\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620360/extras/bcceebd2-9bbb-446a-b79b-24e1d4e4507e.gif?t=1744675198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game begins by identifying objects that can be interacted with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check directly to see what interactions are possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, gather the necessary information from each element to uncover the truth behind the events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620360/b76b693354def3adbd4e8f06ecae8e45ad612db0.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620360/607cb4b441073b8465ee55775e9a867208c070fd.jpg"},{"name":" Chapter 2 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620360/8d1528b6a87b5419136dfe2c2e9d0cdc5b0af1ec.jpg"},{"name":" Chapter 3 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620360/7bd038086e013c9cf1879a70c353e42611f40eaf.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 4 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620360/52b6e996fbca2b298e73de79e38ac59739dab263.jpg"},{"name":"Find Torn Page","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620360/732eeb776e6994d384b5d9c0e58c29188ac028d0.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Dial Lock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620360/9727168480afadcc3baf3f9eea5e9302ca7fe30d.jpg"},{"name":"All Switch Turn On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620360/8d8b214998bc8ac9df1395b919be2628a161893a.jpg"},{"name":"Survive hide and seek","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images